\nKeep up to date with the progress by following Middle Man Games on Twitter.\n(https://twitter.com/MiddleManGames1)", "short_description": "Fly using just the movement of your body!\n\nRug Riders is a magic carpet simulator with a unique movement system that's so authentic, it feels like you're flying a real magic carpet!\n\nBlast enemies with fireballs in the battles, unlock gold medals on the races, or just enjoy flying around the sprawling landscape."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZUtO9p9LGTiyFyrNsbxon0-Z6KMtacVSJDXga8NYG7I/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Middle Man Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://twitter.com/MiddleManGames1", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["FLYING", "RACING", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "399775625359425"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "777883693399024"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "174341515429417"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1549367335635551"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1549367335635551"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1661986800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "777883693399024"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": 